{"version":2,"memos":[{"id":"demo_exhibit","title":"周末看展记录","pinned":false,"createdAt":1795519750964,"updatedAt":1795519750964,"doc":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"de1","children":[{"text":"今天去了 UCCA 的「非物质再现」展。光线透过亚克力板投射在墙上的影子会随着人的移动变化，站久了会忘记时间。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"de2","children":[{"text":"想起上周看的书里那句话：==所谓的边界，只是我们还没习惯的过渡带=="}]},{"type":"heading","id":"de3","children":[{"text":"实用信息"}],"attrs":{"level":2}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"de4","children":[{"text":"地址：798 艺术区 UCCA。票价 100 元。"}]}]},{"id":"demo_home","title":"装修踩坑清单","pinned":true,"createdAt":1795433350964,"updatedAt":1795433350964,"doc":[{"type":"todo","id":"dh1","children":[{"text":"厨房插座至少留 6 个，台面要带开关"}],"attrs":{"checked":true}},{"type":"todo","id":"dh2","children":[{"text":"卫生间防水刷到 1.8m，闭水试验做满 48h"}],"attrs":{"checked":true}},{"type":"todo","id":"dh3","children":[{"text":"地板和瓷砖之间用极窄收边条，不要过门石"}],"attrs":{"checked":false}},{"type":"todo","id":"dh4","children":[{"text":"衣柜做到顶，不要成品柜，顶部积灰严重"}],"attrs":{"checked":false}}]},{"id":"demo_tools","title":"好用的工具网站","pinned":false,"createdAt":1795260550964,"updatedAt":1795260550964,"doc":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"dt1","children":[{"text":"几个日常高频用到的小工具，免费无广告。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"dt2","children":[{"text":"Excalidraw — 画架构图和流程图最顺手的白板。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"dt3","children":[{"text":"Carbon — 把代码生成漂亮的分享图，支持 20+ 主题。"}]}]},{"id":"demo_book","title":"读书笔记｜设计的觉醒","pinned":false,"createdAt":1794914950964,"updatedAt":1794914950964,"doc":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"db1","children":[{"text":"田中一光的随笔集，断断续续读了一个月。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"db2","children":[{"text":"「设计不是一种技能，而是捕捉事物本质的感觉和洞察力。」"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"db3","children":[{"text":"「整理、排布、思考——设计的本质就是这三件事的循环。」"}]}]},{"id":"demo_music","title":"最近在听的歌","pinned":false,"createdAt":1794310150964,"updatedAt":1794310150964,"doc":[{"type":"heading","id":"dm1","children":[{"text":"上周循环最多的几首"}],"attrs":{"level":2}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"dm2","children":[{"text":"She Her Her Hers — Arrows — 吉他前奏一响整